WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.380
Useful content, social media, email, and WhatsApp that sells.

2
00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:09.980
This is the video for module three: content, social media, email and WhatsApp.

3
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:21.260
Content marketing means attracting customers by being useful, not only by shouting buy now. Pillars stop you staring at your phone wondering what to post.

4
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.720
Teach. A salon posts how to protect braids at night.

5
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.280
Show. A time-lapse of a style, or your clean station.

6
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:37.570
Prove. Before-and-after photos, client voice notes and reviews. Always ask before posting a client's face.

7
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:47.930
Sell. This week's prices and open slots. If every post is an advert, people stop watching. If none sell, they never know how to buy.

8
00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:58.270
Halima's salon gets the same question every week: how do I make my braids last longer? She recorded a 45-second video with three tips.

9
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:07.540
She posted it as a Reel and a TikTok. The caption opens with a hook: want your braids to last 6 weeks? Do these 3 things.

10
00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.050
That evening, the same video went on her WhatsApp Status.

11
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.500
She turned the tips into a photo carousel for Facebook.

12
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:28.030
And she saved them as a quick reply, to send in one tap. One hour of work made five pieces of content. End every caption with one clear call to action.

13
00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:35.790
Choose one or two platforms where your customers are, and switch to a business account to unlock free insights.

14
00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:49.520
Amaka's photo of a platter reached 2,000 people and got 80 likes, comments, shares and saves. Engagement rate is engagements divided by reach, times 100. That is 4%.

15
00:01:50.770 --> 00:02:02.370
Her short video packing an order reached fewer people, 1,200, but got 120 engagements. That is 10%, and it brought three times the enquiries.

16
00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:07.760
So she makes more behind-the-scenes videos, and checks the pattern holds over several weeks.

17
00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:17.710
Platforms can cut your reach overnight. An email list is yours. But build it only with consent, as data protection law expects.

18
00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:23.720
Use an email marketing tool. It adds an unsubscribe link to every email.

19
00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:29.580
Three ways to store your ankara so colours last, beats Newsletter number 4.

20
00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.530
Give one useful item, and one clear button.

21
00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:43.740
Open rates can count emails nobody read, so trust clicks and sales more. And never buy lists, because your emails will land in spam.

22
00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:54.320
Ngozi sends to 800 subscribers. 16 bounce, so she removes those addresses. 47 people click Shop the Easter set.

23
00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:05.680
Her UTM link shows 8 orders, at about 12,000 naira each. That is about 96,000 naira, from an email that cost her only time.

24
00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:09.950
Only 4 people unsubscribe, so she keeps her monthly rhythm.

25
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:20.160
WhatsApp is where many sales happen. WhatsApp Business adds a catalog, a greeting message, quick replies and labels. Tag each new chat.

26
00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:28.710
Once a day, open Price sent. Follow up once, kindly. Then stop, because repeated chasing annoys people.

27
00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:35.270
Mark a chat Paid only when the money shows in your bank app. Never from a screenshot alone.

28
00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:41.410
Then delivered, and after a few days, ask how they found it and share your review link.

29
00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:54.220
Bisi sends her weekly menu to 180 customers who saved her number and agreed. 42 reply, and 31 order. When two reply STOP, she removes them at once.

30
00:03:54.570 --> 00:04:01.400
Never add strangers to groups. Confirm every payment in your bank app, and turn on two-step verification.

31
00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:10.600
To remember. Plan with your pillars, and turn one idea into many posts. Compare posts by engagement and enquiries.

32
00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:17.460
Build email and WhatsApp lists only with permission. And a sale is paid only when your bank app says so.

33
00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:29.040
Now practise. Write your pillars and a two-week calendar, set up your main platform, create an email sign-up form, and label your last 20 WhatsApp chats.

34
00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.330
Continue with the lessons below.
